    <Notes>Fork air spring characteristics approximate stock forks with aftermarket pressurized cartridges.

Fork length dimensioned from top of outer tube to center of front axle, fully extended (top-out springs compressed).

Center of gravity location is assumed.  Actual location is dependent on rider position and weight, fuel load, etc.

Frame is dimensioned to center of pivot hole, without pivot insert.

Frame headstock height and upper yoke height are dimensioned to the large machined surface around the stock cover.  
The upper yoke height is dimensioned to the flat surface surrounding the fork leg. 

Swingarm pivot eccentric has 2 mm radius, with marked adjustments in 2 mm vertical increments.
Stock pivot position as delivered is +2 mm vertical UP (3 dots at bottom).
Please note that the possible adjustments are:
3 dots at bottom = 0 mm horizontal / +2.0 mm vertical
2 dots at bottom = +2.0 mm hor / +0.0 mm vert
1 dots at bottom =  0 mm hor / -2.0 mm vert

Stock tires:
Front: Dunlop SportSmart TT 120/70-17
Rear: Dunlop SportSmart TT 200/55-17
</Notes>
